meta {
  name: Get Config
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/config
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## Get Public Config

  Returns public server configuration for clients and agents.

  **Auth** — none

  **Responses**
  - `200` — `{ allowedEmailDomains, PRODUCTS, PRODUCT_SETTINGS, TRADING_SESSION, QUOTE_SESSION, INITIAL_BUDGET, FIXED_FEE, PERCENTAGE_FEE }`

  **Fields**
  | Field               | Type    | Description                                      |
  |---------------------|---------|--------------------------------------------------|
  | allowedEmailDomains | array   | Domains allowed for registration                 |
  | PRODUCTS            | array   | List of tradeable product names                  |
  | PRODUCT_SETTINGS    | object  | Per-product price limits (MAX_BUY/MIN_BUY/…)     |
  | TRADING_SESSION     | string  | FIX trading session path                         |
  | QUOTE_SESSION       | string  | FIX quote session path                           |
  | INITIAL_BUDGET      | number  | Starting budget for new user accounts            |
  | FIXED_FEE           | number  | Fixed fee per order                              |
  | PERCENTAGE_FEE      | number  | Percentage fee per order                         |
}
